    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b1b933d9dda157f47d9af9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加的话，能获得相当宝贵的经验。\n目白阿尔丹热身时的状况不错，\n我想不到阻止她的理由。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87c07a177ed8bf05f6bd3551daeb68dc589ba29cfa18c2723717dc97c2b93bde",
