      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹和八重无敌参加了\n学园主办的公益戏剧演出活动，\n来到了医院。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c65e7ebef9a0decd3a1b086cbd029df94da6a38a4343a37c5b62d1ddfbf6747",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
