      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "例如在舞会的场景，\n灰姑娘会骄傲地断然拒绝\n邀请她跳舞的王子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4d8769f7a27f5f0979748ec338ca4fea3ba0265dcb160920c2b22a38fc1f070",
